{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2022-01", "window": 4, "start_date": 1642982400, "end_date": 1643673599, "month_true_total": 1173, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:49:39 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "109213464", "author": {"steamid": "76561198175569279", "personaname": "Pilk Addict", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198175569279/", "num_games_owned": 303, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 2315, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1805, "last_played": 1734308077, "avatar": "952bf3985582602006793cb4811154997998807e"}, "language": "english", "review": "The satisfaction of one shotting with the golden bow is the only thing you need in this game", "timestamp_created": 1643672565, "timestamp_updated": 1643672565, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 12, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "109212017", "author": {"steamid": "76561198093732740", "personaname": "FireSlinger35", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/FireSlinger/", "num_games_owned": 512, "num_reviews": 45, "playtime_forever": 5293, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1697, "last_played": 1726594234, "avatar": "b796b4c5b1de91321775964081c6f71e096142ee"}, "language": "english", "review": "best rougelike there is spent 28 hours so far a got to level 101 so", "timestamp_created": 1643670746, "timestamp_updated": 1643670746, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "109210634", "author": {"steamid": "76561199161303194", "personaname": "TanukiTycho", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TanukiTycho/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 3974, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 705, "last_played": 1686774415, "avatar": "9626c3ebb129de374aeaca93fdb99de7a27a4020"}, "language": "english", "review": "Okay- first off lets get this out out of the way- yes the game is easier then most rogue-likes, the list would go like this from Easiest to Hardest: Gunfire Reborn, Binding of Isaac(Base Game), Risk of Rain 2, Binding of Isaac(Tainted/afterbirth/etc.) \n\nThis does not take away from the experience at all, this game is ridiculously easily addicting. The game will reward you for everying, including death or dying multiple times, which- actually is a good thing to die. \nEvery death is something new learned, and something new gained in power hence the \"Reborn\" part. Which it feels good not just because you'll notice your strength level up faster and faster, but because you don't have to do some complicated ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ you'll have you look up How to do. Its like: Kill (x) enemy (x) amount of times or (x) way.  Oh- and Grinding isn't bad at all, you'll get the \"Special Money\" or \"Skill Money\" pretty common and casually as you play.\n\nAlso personal advice: I know Tao (the Bunny girl) is cute, and you may gravitate towards her immediately for a first unlock, but do yourself a favor, and don't upgrade your tree at least to skill level 25, or if you absolutely Must do it, then do it with a friend, the grind will be quicker.", "timestamp_created": 1643668968, "timestamp_updated": 1643668968, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "109210494", "author": {"steamid": "76561198264812043", "personaname": "Slow", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198264812043/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 5734, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 430, "last_played": 1778895526, "avatar": "e4c5e2ab869df41657cb2108f0d01723d0ba7ba7"}, "language": "english", "review": "good\n", "timestamp_created": 1643668773, "timestamp_updated": 1643668773, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "109206608", "author": {"steamid": "76561199106549516", "personaname": "MCDOOF", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mcdizzy_land/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 6969, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5853, "last_played": 1777746322, "avatar": "8217aa7660b1c3a65ac5ca1a057fe3569ea31ace"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun as ♥♥♥♥", "timestamp_created": 1643664136, "timestamp_updated": 1643664136, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "109206386", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006830924", "personaname": "Pana", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198006830924/", "num_games_owned": 51, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_fo